dialogueText = Array[String](["Well done, young-un.", "Thanks master!", "However... I have to return the things around here in the state they were before, or they'll catch us.", "You'll also lose this transformation, it will make moving around here too easy...", "Why can't I have it easy, master?", "Because... if you can't enter the mansion on your own and have to rely on my help, you'll get captured A LOT.", "Ohhh! I getcha.", "Don't worry though, if you can find the statue in it's original location it's yours to use.", "Yippie!"])
